# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo is edited on Windows but built on Linux (Cloudflare Pages). Without
# this, every file Git touches gets rewritten with CRLF locally and shows up as
# a whole-file change in every diff, which makes review useless.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything as LF in the repository and checks it
# out as LF. Node, Next.js and the build toolchain are all fine with LF on
# Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted - doing so corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.m4v binary
*.mov binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary

# Generated - collapse in diffs and skip language stats.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
